### 1. Analytics (baseline)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. Register a NEW pending CC (self-serve registration)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "universityId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "fullName": "Alice Test CC",
  "matricule": "UBA23E0099",
  "email": "alice.test@freehall.cm",
  "department": "Computer Engineering",
  "level": "Level 200",
  "role": "cc",
  "password": "AlicePass123",
  "confirmPassword": "AlicePass123"
}

### 3. List pending users — Alice should appear
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/pending-users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Suggest a new hall (creates pending hall)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/halls/suggest
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin Test Hall",
  "zone": "COLTECH",
  "capacityTier": "small",
  "approxCapacityRange": "< 50"
}

### 5. List pending halls — Admin Test Hall should appear
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/pending-halls
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Approve Alice (need her user ID from #3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/PASTE_ALICE_ID/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. Approve Admin Test Hall (need hall ID from #5)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/halls/PASTE_HALL_ID/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Analytics (after approvals — pending counts should drop)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. Suspend Bob
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/PASTE_BOB_USER_ID/suspend
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. Try to use Bob's token after suspend (should fail — 403 SUSPENDED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

### 11. Reinstate Bob
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/PASTE_BOB_USER_ID/reinstate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 12. Attempt to suspend a super_admin (should fail — 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/PASTE_ADMIN_ID/suspend
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 13. No auth (should fail — 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/pending-users

### 14. As CC (should fail — 403 FORBIDDEN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/pending-users
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

### 15. Cleanup: reject the test hall (from #4, if it wasn't approved)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/halls/PASTE_HALL_ID/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}